      "content": "it's just hard to see it as \"self-determination\" when it feels so heavy. like, if i actually did it, would that really be \"winning\"? or am i just proving that the system won by finally breaking me? i'm just wondering if there's actually any dignity in that, or if it's just the only way to be truly free from the noise.",
